    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Quantum Tanks&quot; combines 3D, top-down shooting, and classic tank battle gameplay. Use agile maneuvering to defeat all enemy tanks and clear the levels.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique shell interception mechanic: You can fire shells to detonate enemy shells.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If a tank's shell is detonated at close range, it will also deal damage to the tank itself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seven carefully designed maps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No health pickups in the maps\u2014only various types of cover. The satisfaction of defeating powerful enemies is a key highlight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All enemies are equipped with high-level AI systems. They automatically seek your position and fire shells at the right moment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you start a level, enemy tanks will patrol in different patterns, providing a fresh experience every time you play.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>Game Controls \u2014 &quot;W, S&quot; control the forward and backward movement of the tank, &quot;A, D&quot; control the rotation of the tank, hold the left mouse button to control the firing position, and release it to fire the shell.</u></i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Quantum Tanks&quot; combines 3D, top-down shooting, and classic tank battle gameplay. Use agile maneuvering to defeat all enemy tanks and clear the levels.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique shell interception mechanic: You can fire shells to detonate enemy shells.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If a tank's shell is detonated at close range, it will also deal damage to the tank itself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seven carefully designed maps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No health pickups in the maps\u2014only various types of cover. The satisfaction of defeating powerful enemies is a key highlight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All enemies are equipped with high-level AI systems. They automatically seek your position and fire shells at the right moment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you start a level, enemy tanks will patrol in different patterns, providing a fresh experience every time you play.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>Game Controls \u2014 &quot;W, S&quot; control the forward and backward movement of the tank, &quot;A, D&quot; control the rotation of the tank, hold the left mouse button to control the firing position, and release it to fire the shell.</u></i></p>",
